  "body": "# Feat\r\n- use the new std.heap.SafeAllocator (e1cf13f)\r\n\r\n# Build\r\n- use translate-c as an explicit external dependency (3b4b4a4)\r\n- bump minimum zig version to 0.17.0 (8a16696)\r\n- build.zig: update build system to 0.17 (0ac832f)\r\n\r\n# Refactor\r\n- utils: use '@backingInt' instead of '@intFromEnum' (393ee52)\r\n- use 'std.mem.Allocator.print' instead of 'std.fmt.allocPrint' (bab7b8d)\r\n- build.zig: use 'target.os.tag' instead of 'os.tag' (acf4e16)\r\n- detection: use 'target.os.tag' instead of 'os.tag' (84ea6fe)\r\n\r\n# CI\r\n- build: bump zig version to 0.17.0 (7ee0301)"
